    {
      "text": "像构筑牌组一样增删改符文并叠加护符光环",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Customize rune columns in a deck-building experience to suit your strategy. Add, remove, and modify Runes for personalized gameplay. Enhance runes with amulets and auras for additional effects when cast.",
