      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "150种饰品叠出触发组合并用强敌换商店资金",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Explore 150 Trinkets to discover synergies and crazy combos. Increase damage and damage multipliers. Trigger Runes multiple times. Gain extra Rune holds. Make Runes match with different elements. Choose starting enemies with unique abilities, balancing risk and reward. Earn coins for defeating stronger foes and spend them across five specialized shops.",
